    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιφάσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dart, rush about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιφάσσουσα διέσσυτο λαὸν Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.450
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1440
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.136C.
				</span></i>
			; <i>quiver</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>H.</u>
				2.288
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans.,
				<i>wave violently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jo.Gaz.
					<u>Ecphr.</u>
					2.167
				</span></i>
			. (Redupl. form; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-φάσσειν</span>, Lat. <i>fax.</i>)</div>
